    },
    {
      "name": "honey",
      "amount": "1 tablespoon",
      "notes": "for marinade"
    }
  ],
  "instructions": [
    "Preheat grill to medium-high heat.",
    "In a large bowl, whisk together soy sauce, honey, and vegetable oil. Add tofu and vegetables, and toss to coat.",
    "Thread tofu and vegetables onto skewers, leaving a small space between each piece.",
    "Brush skewers with remaining marinade.",
    "Grill skewers for 8-10 minutes, turning occasionally, or until tofu is golden brown and vegetables are tender.",
    "Serve skewers hot with fluffy coleslaw made by mixing shredded cabbage with 1 tablespoon mayonnaise and 1 tablespoon apple cider vinegar.",
    "Garnish with chopped fresh herbs, if desired."
